8	69b366e4-3443-42df-9766-e9c53a4e8dd4	2025-03-20 09:36:49.052949+00	AI Solutions Intern	As an AI Solutions Intern, you will work on real-world AI applications, including natural language processing (NLP), computer vision, and predictive analytics. You will help develop AI-driven business insights and automation solutions.	["Develop and test AI/ML models for client solutions.", "Assist in training and tuning machine learning models.", "Work with IBM Watson and other AI frameworks.", "Support AI model deployment in cloud environments.", "Conduct data preprocessing, feature engineering, and model evaluation.", "Analyze business problems and recommend AI-powered insights.", "Assist in developing automation solutions using AI-driven techniques.", "Collaborate with technical teams to optimize AI model performance."]	["Familiarity with machine learning frameworks such as TensorFlow, PyTorch, and Scikit-learn.", "Knowledge of programming languages such as Python, R, or SQL.", "Experience with data preprocessing, feature engineering, and model evaluation.", "Basic understanding of cloud computing and AI model deployment.", "Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.", "Ability to work with large datasets and extract meaningful insights.", "Interest in AI-driven automation and business intelligence applications."]	8 hour shift	Monday - Friday	7	t	7
